# .deployallow — explicit allowlist for automatic ThirdParty deployment.
#
# Empty by default: NO third-party DLL is deployed automatically. This is
# intentional; the previous .deployignore approach defaulted to "deploy
# everything not listed", which put all 268 ThirdParty DLLs into Mods\.
#
# One pattern per line, POSIX glob relative to ThirdParty/, forward slashes:
#   *      any characters except /
#   **     any characters including /
#   **/    zero or more directories
#   ?      one character except /
#
# Examples (do NOT uncomment without reviewing the actual DLL):
#   MyMod/dist/MyMod.dll
#   MyMod/**/*.dll
#
# Missing or malformed allowlists fail the deploy. Lines starting with # and
# blank lines are ignored. Duplicate target file names are rejected because
# Mods\ is flat.
